<article class="env-example" id="0EVG">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0EVG">Example <span data-tag="0EVG">38.37.10</span>.</a> Let $A$ be a ring. Let $f \in A$ be an element. Let $J \subset A$ be a finitely generated ideal annihilated by a power of $f$. Then </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[  \xymatrix{ E = \mathop{\mathrm{Spec}}(A/fA + J) \ar[r] \ar[d] &  \mathop{\mathrm{Spec}}(A/J) = X' \ar[d] \\  Z = \mathop{\mathrm{Spec}}(A/fA) \ar[r] &  \mathop{\mathrm{Spec}}(A) = X }  \]
</div>
  <p> is an almost blowup square. </p>
